<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Makes a creature use a talent or ability. Will add ability to the creature if asked to Ability Use command is added to the top of the action queue unless otherwise specified. This function is asynchronous as it uses a command.
</p><p>The command can still fail if the creature doesn't have the mana to use it, etc.
</p><p><br />
</p><p><br />
